  "lines": [
   {
    "id": "n01",
    "at_s": 0.47,
    "text": "Every time the world built something big,"
   },
   {
    "id": "n02",
    "at_s": 3.05,
    "text": "somebody had to move it."
   },
   {
    "id": "n03",
    "at_s": 5.16,
    "text": "Rails, across a continent."
   },
   {
    "id": "n04",
    "at_s": 7.5,
    "text": "Steam, across the ocean."
   },
   {
    "id": "n05",
    "at_s": 9.84,
    "text": "Then we put the world in a box,"
   },
   {
    "id": "n06",
    "at_s": 12.0,
    "text": "and gave it wings."
   },
   {
    "id": "n07",
    "at_s": 15.23,
    "text": "Even the Moon had to be shipped."
   },
   {
    "id": "n08",
    "at_s": 21.56,
    "text": "Now, we're building again."
   },
   {
    "id": "n09",
    "at_s": 23.44,
    "text": "Data centers."
   },
   {
    "id": "n10",
    "at_s": 24.84,
    "text": "Microchips."
   },
   {
    "id": "n11",
    "at_s": 26.25,
    "text": "Robots."
   },
   {
    "id": "n12",
    "at_s": 27.19,
    "text": "Power."
   },
   {
    "id": "n13",
    "at_s": 28.13,
    "text": "Defense."
   },
   {
    "id": "n14",
    "at_s": 30.2,
    "text": "The biggest build of our lifetime."
   },
   {
    "id": "n15",
    "at_s": 32.4,
    "text": "And every piece of it has to move."
   },
   {
    "id": "n16",
    "at_s": 34.9,
    "text": "Across oceans. Through borders. On time."
   },
   {
    "id": "n17",
    "at_s": 37.73,
    "text": "This isn't just freight anymore."
   },
   {
    "id": "n18",
    "at_s": 39.6,
    "text": "It's the mission."
   },
   {
    "id": "n19",
    "at_s": 41.5,
    "text": "And logistics has to step up."
   },
   {
    "id": "n20",
    "at_s": 43.8,
    "text": "Bigger. Faster. Built for it."
   },
   {
    "id": "n21",
    "at_s": 49.05,
    "text": "Software ate the world."
   },
   {
    "id": "n22",
    "at_s": 50.85,
    "text": "Somebody has to ship it."
   },
   {
